you're using family="gaussian", which seems to me not to be the most
obvious choice for frequency data. this is why predictions turn
negative...

if its a normalized frequency, like a probability, then maybe
family="beta" is good choice, if not, maybe use Gaussian on the
log(data) scale, ie, family="lognormal"

Best
H

