Precision for idx (component 1)

	precision for the first component of the iid2d model

Precision for idx (component 2)

	precision for the second component of the iid2d model

Rho1:2 for idx

	the correlation between first and second component of the iid2d
model

GroupRho for idx

	the correlation in the AR1 model

